SUMMARY:Clothing Swap @ The Rheu Company Sewing Studio
DESCRIPTION:Offer things that deserve to be worn\, find as many new-to-you things as you can grab – plus\, it’s a great cause. The Rheu Company Sewing Studio’s semi-annual clothing swap. While you’re switching your closets from summer to winter\, bring things that don’t speak to you anymore and refresh your style with things that deserve to be worn! We’re building community around fighting textile waste. Plus\, you’re supporting the woman-owned tailoring and upholstery sewing studio! 💖 \nBring clean clothes\, shoes\, jewelry\, bags\, accessories\, costumes\, whatever. The cover charge is waived if you drop off items by 5pm on Thursday\, November 5th. Last donation accepted is at 1pm on Saturday\, during the event. (bonus points for hangers)\nThere’s no limit to the number of items you take – take what’s cool or useful to you!\nCover Charge: $10 at the door (cards accepted) (This fee is waived if items are dropped off by 5pm on Thursday\, November 5th)​\nUnclaimed items will be gifted to local donation sites to help our community.​\nIf it’s free\, you should invest in some alterations and make it fit. Duh. \nSee you there!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/clothing-swap-the-rheu-company-sewing-studio/2026-11-07/
LOCATION:The Rheu Sewing Studio\, 618 Foster St.\, Durham\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Free,Shopping
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Instagram-Post-45-8.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="The Rheu Co. Sewing Studio":MAILTO:jillrheutan@therheuco.com
GEO:36.0026887;-78.9011743
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Rheu Sewing Studio 618 Foster St. Durham 27701 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=618 Foster St.:geo:-78.9011743,36.0026887
END:VEVENT
