SUMMARY:GOLDEN BELT ARTISTS WINTER MARKET 2026
DESCRIPTION:Shop Local. Gift Original Skip the mass-produced retail items and join us for a day dedicated to discovering incredible local artists! \nJoining the studios will be 30 local makers\, artists\, and craftspeople under one roof at the historic Golden Belt Art Studios in downtown Durham. Explore fine art\, ceramics\, custom jewelry\, original prints\, and paper goods\, all made locally with a story to tell. \n🎟️ EVENT DETAILS:\n🗓️ Date: Saturday\, November 7\, 2026\n⏰ Time: 11:00 AM – 3:00 PM\n📍 Location: Golden Belt Art Studios (800 Taylor St\, Durham\, NC 27701)\n🎟️ Admission: FREE & open to the public!\n🅿️ Parking: Free on-site parking available throughout the campus\n🎉 SPECIAL HIGHLIGHT: We’re hosting a Half-Hour Raffle! \nEvery 30 minutes from 11:30 AM to 3:00 PM\, we’ll draw a lucky winner on the mic to win original artwork donated by our studio artists! \nBring your family\, tag your favorite shopping buddy\, and get ready to check off your holiday list with original gifts you won’t find anywhere else.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/golden-belt-artists-winter-market-2026/
LOCATION:Golden Belt Arts\, 800 Taylor Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art,Community Engagement,Free,Gifts,Holiday,Markets,Shopping
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Final-2026-Winter-Mkt-with-Graphics.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Golden Belt Artists":MAILTO:tiffany@tiffanycoley.com
GEO:35.99116;-78.889691
