SUMMARY:Jake Shimabukuro - Durham
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an unforgettable evening as the extraordinary Jake Shimabukuro takes the stage at the iconic Carolina Theatre – Durham! Known for his mesmerizing ukulele skills and innovative sound\, Jake will captivate audiences with his unique blend of traditional Hawaiian music and contemporary influences. The intimate atmosphere of this historic venue will enhance the experience\, allowing fans to feel every note and rhythm as they embark on a musical journey like no other. \nJoin us for “”Jake Shimabukuro – Durham”” and immerse yourself in a night filled with passion\, creativity\, and pure musical magic. Whether you’re a longtime fan or new to his music\, this concert promises to be a highlight of the season. Don’t miss your chance to witness this incredible performance—secure your tickets today and be part of an evening that will resonate long after the final chord!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/jake-shimabukuro-durham/
LOCATION:Carolina Theatre of Durham\, 309 W Morgan St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Jake-Shimabukuro.jpg
