SUMMARY:BABY JANE at the fruit
DESCRIPTION:Morning Choir presents Los Angeles electronic visionary BABY JANE for an immersive night of gothic house\, witch house\, and ethereal horror on her ‘Winter Forever’ Tour. Her sound blends witch house\, hardstyle\, and ethereal pop into something that refuses easy categorization\, drawing from melancholic 1980s Russian pop\, personal experience\, and a self-penned mythology centered on the occult and spirituality. Her 2025 album “Winter Forever” represents the next evolution of an artist standing at the crest of a new wave of internet-native electronic music. Expect gothic atmospheres\, ethereal vocals\, and an immersive artistic vision.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/baby-jane-at-the-fruit/
LOCATION:Durham Fruit Company\, 305 S Dillard St\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Concert
