SUMMARY:Beauty School Dropout with No Love for the Middle Child
DESCRIPTION:Beauty School Dropout is an American rock and alternative/punk band from Los Angeles\, California\, formed in 2020. \nNo Love for The Middle Child is a producer\, songwriter\, artist\, and multi-instrumentalist (classically trained cellist\, guitarist\, drummer\, etc) based out of Los Angeles\, originally from Philadelphia. Recently No Love has been writing and producing on the entire mgk album releasing this year\, and has recently just had a release with Jelly Roll on his “Beautifully Broken (Don’t Pick Up The Pieces)” album. No Love has also had past release with artists like Willow\, Maggie Lindemann\, Tomorrow X Together\, Tom Morello (Venom “One Last Dance” Theme song)\, Travis Barker\, Sueco\, Steve Aoki\, Meek Mill\, Juicewrld\, Megan Thee Stallion and more.
