SUMMARY:Durham Chess Club
DESCRIPTION:Join the Durham Chess Club for a relaxed\, welcoming weekly chess night at Durham Food Hall. Whether you’re brand new and learning the moves or you’ve been playing for years\, you’ll find friendly games\, new opponents\, and a low-pressure space to improve. Come solo or bring a friend—drop in anytime during the event window.\nWhen: Weekly\, 5:45 PM–8:00 PM \nWhere: Durham Food Hall \nExpect casual match play\, quick games\, and plenty of conversation. All ages and skill levels are welcome; we’ll help pair you up for games. Grab food or a drink from the hall and settle in for a great midweek community hang.
