SUMMARY:Velvet Rewind: R&B Wednesdays at The Velvet Hippo!
DESCRIPTION:Every Wednesday evening from 6 to 9pm\, we’re taking it back to the golden age of R&B with Velvet Rewind by Jorden The DJ! Enjoy smooth vibes from artists like D’Angelo\, Mary J. Blige\, Usher\, Whitney\, Horace Brown\, and more while you sip on a throwback drink special (think appletini\, Midori sour\, and Royal Flush). Whether you’re meeting up with your crew after work\, celebrating a birthday\, or making it a cozy date night\, one thing is for sure…a time will be had every week!
