SUMMARY:Mahjong Night
DESCRIPTION:Mahjong is a mesmerizing game of skill\, strategy\, and calculation involving domino-like tiles. It’s easy to learn but offers endless depth\, making it incredibly addictive. So come grab a drink and try your hand at it at Glass Jug Downtown on select Wednesdays this fall! \nGet Your Mahjong NC will teach a hands-on class to learn the basics of American Mahjong\, to build confidence\, and start playing right away. No experience needed – we’ll bring everything. \nAlready played\, but still need assistance with the game? We’ll also have guided play. \nCome from 6:30 – 8:30pm to learn to build sequences\, pairs\, pungs\, and kongs while enjoying our rotating selection of craft beer and unique cocktails. \nJoin us to learn a new skill\, challenge your brain\, and maybe even find your lucky tile! \nIntroduction Class for beginners: $40/pp\nGuided Play: $20/pp\nOpen Play: $10/pp\nSimply fill out the form at this link to reserve your space on any date and pay. \nView on Facebook. \nHappens on the following Dates:\nOct 14\, 2026\, 6:30pm to 8:30pm\nOct 28\, 2026\, 6:30pm to 8:30pm\nNov 11\, 2026\, 6:30pm to 8:30pm\nNov 25\, 2026\, 6:30pm to 8:30pm\nDec 9\, 2026\, 6:30pm to 8:30pm\nDec 16\, 2026\, 6:30pm to 8:30pm
